{"seq":61,"ts":"2026-09-30T10:28:53.620Z","id":"01M3RXRB7M7F0ZCRXV5MV98XTR","type":"tool/result","lane":"main","v":1,"actor":{"id":"Administrator","org":"local","role":"owner","deptPath":[],"attrs":{"surface":"session"}},"origin":"tool:skill_read","trust":"trusted","data":{"toolUseId":"t0-0992fb49a15c5e139c8bdcca0e7669ef","content":[{"type":"text","text":"resourceId: skill/workspace/workspace-agnes/d60f41663731a034f5fd75507918f0d65ec6d4b72da0ce19931fb4a4ae9e77f6\nrevision: 79ba9a26c5fe53d916b7316a71010b2f1650a2841c1cb174187427403715a3c0\ndirectory: D:\\TSI\\agentic-phm-contest\\.agh\\skills\\diagnosis\n\nBase directory for this Skill: D:\\TSI\\agentic-phm-contest\\.agh\\skills\\diagnosis\nResolve relative paths this Skill mentions (for example scripts/ or references/) against that directory. Read those files with the read tool and run its scripts with the shell, loading them only as needed; the directory is read-only.\n\n\n# 旋转机械自主诊断策略（P-101）\n\n## 工具（全部 GET，用 web_fetch 或 curl 调用，base=http://127.0.0.1:8181）\n/api/device  /api/trend?point&kpi&hours  /api/waveform?point&n  /api/spectrum?point&type&top\n/api/charfreq?rpm  /api/alarm/history?equip  /api/task/create?title&desc&level&source\n/api/report/submit?run_id&equip&conclusion&confidence&evidence_json\n\n## 诊断假设表（按序取证，每步记录\"假设→证据→支持/排除\"）\n| 假设 | 判据 |\n|---|---|\n| 轴承外圈 BPFO | 包络谱在 BPFO±3Hz 有显著峰，且随负载/时间增长 |\n| 轴承内圈 BPFI | 包络谱在 BPFI±3Hz（可能有 1×fr 边带） |\n| 滚动体 BSF / 保持架 FTF | 包络谱在 BSF/FTF±3Hz |\n| 不对中 | 2×fr 幅值 > 1×fr 的 1/3，径向为主 |\n| 不平衡 | 1×fr 占优、相位稳定 |\n| 误报 | 趋势无恶化 + 频谱无特征峰 + 峭度≈3 |\n\n## 流程（≥3 连续步骤，覆盖规划→调用→反馈→验证）\n1. 规划：读 /api/device 确认等级；列出候选假设。\n2. 取证：/api/trend（是否持续恶化）→ /api/spectrum type=fft（1×/2×）→ type=envelope（特征频率）→\n   /api/charfreq 换算理论频率与谱峰比对（±3Hz 容差）→ /api/alarm/history 佐证。\n3. 交叉验证：时域（峭度>4）与频域（特征峰）与趋势（连续上升）三者至少两项一致才可下结论。\n4. 结论：conclusion + confidence + 逐条证据（引用接口返回数值）。\n5. 行动：/api/task/create（level=severe 时标题含\"停机检查\"）。\n6. 验证：复查 /api/device 与报告落库结果一致，向用户汇报差异。\n\n## 非完美路径（必须真实执行，不许跳过）\n- 证据不足两项一致 → 不下结论，明确列出\"还缺什么证据\"并继续取证；\n- 某工具超时/报错 → 换等价工具（waveform+本地计算替代 spectrum）重试一次并记录；\n- 全部假设被排除 → 结论\"误报\"，给出排除依据。\n\n## 输出\n最终必调 /api/report/submit，evidence_json 为数组：[{step, tool, key_numbers, supports}]。\n"}],"structured":{"name":"diagnosis","resourceId":"skill/workspace/workspace-agnes/d60f41663731a034f5fd75507918f0d65ec6d4b72da0ce19931fb4a4ae9e77f6","offset":0,"totalBytes":2394},"isError":false,"enforcement":{"level":"partial","scope":["file"]},"authz":{"decisionId":"n/a"}},"sourceEventSeqs":[57]}
